title: SAP MaxDB: Locks and deadlocks
agents: linux, windows
catalog: app/maxdb
license: GPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Lock entry utilization, waiting lock requestors, cumulative deadlocks and collisions. The database must provide SYSINFO.LOCKSTATISTICS.
 Requires the MaxDB agent plugin with the maxdb_locks module enabled.
 Thresholds can be configured using the MaxDB extended monitoring ruleset.
item:
 Database name
discovery:
 One service is discovered for each database with the corresponding agent section.
